 "submission": {
  "summary": "F-12's missing BHP after 2010-10-11 is a downhole gauge failure, not a reservoir pressure collapse. BHP went from 253.85 bar on 2010-10-11 to null on 2010-10-12 and stayed missing for 2,095 days while the well kept flowing, producing 1,133,053 Sm3 oil over 1,830 flowing days with WHP and rates continuing.",
  "findings": [
   {
    "claim": "BHP was healthy immediately before loss: monthly mean 273.38 bar in 2010-10, with daily readings 272.76 bar on 2010-10-10 and 253.85 bar on 2010-10-11, then null from 2010-10-12 onward.",
